{#-
  Three rows of "HODnop01" at opsz 144, 14 and 8. The opsz 144 and 8
  rows are built from the parametric axes and step through them one at
  a time, see opsz144 and opsz8 below.
-#}
{%- set sample = "HODnop01" %}
{%- set stageWidth = 1336 %}
